'''Arctic''' is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2022 Christmas Box|Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2022|2022 Christmas Event]].  It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
The knife uses the default knife mesh. It has a grey blade with bright blue cracks along it. The guard is blue and the handle is black. 

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Arctic (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name.
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].

